Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:39.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take a look at this photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:42.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The girl in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.95,0:01:46.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've seen her somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She isn't the girl from Tokura Electronics, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:51.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:58.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Kokoku Brigade, a sect of the Human\NEmancipation Front, kidnapped her 16 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:01.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She is Eka, the Tokura Electronics\Npresident's only daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:06.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nice expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:11.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was a time when people didn't get a cyberbrain as casually as they do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:19.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This kid was given a cyberbrain to advertise\Nher father's company's latest product.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:27.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But as a result, she caught their eye\Nand was kidnapped...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:30.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, I remember it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Somehow, I think this is our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:35.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:39.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That case was never solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:45.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They didn't find her even though they raided\Nmany hideouts and asked a lot of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, this picture was taken when she was kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:51.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, that's from two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:57.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are at a radioactive decontamination plant\N200 nautical miles off the shores of Okinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:01.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A member of the Japanese Coast\NGuard SST took this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Two days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That means this isn't really her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:10.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wouldn't necessarily say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.99,0:03:15.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Japanese Coast Guard sent advance troops\Nto the plant for a secret investigation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,when they received information about\Nthe Brigade landing at the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.29,0:03:23.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They just happened to find her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This DNA data came with the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:38.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't know how the SST got this data, but it\Nis an exact match with her past medical records.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:45.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the last thing we heard from the\Ntroops, we lost contact with all four of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:47.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:53.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will see what is going on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:58.75,Default,,450,0,485,,UNEQUAL \N \N TERRORIST
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, how is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:39.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.79,0:04:41.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's no trace of anyone entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:47.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even the Brigade did not come\Ndown to the lowest level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:50.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:55.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, the deck was secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:05:01.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The security system is doing better than expected, even\Nthough it has been left unattended for more than 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:04.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's attached to the ship quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:05.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are no problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:18.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, is there any movement above the plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:24.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's quitE calm, just right for night fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:38.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is one GPS transmission that\Nwe can confirm is from an SST member.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:44.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's possible that he will come out of\Nthe plant on his own when he sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:47.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It only takes you two minutes to land, so standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:48.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:51.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.19,0:05:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:56.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you say we take a leisurely\Ntourist flight while we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:10.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, it's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:18.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ahh... umm... if you permit,\NI can destroy the barricade...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:19.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:23.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Act like an adult when we're\Nclosing in on the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:24.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:27.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it'll be a pain in the butt,\Nbut we'll have to find another way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:34.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There must be something going on up\Nahead, since there's a barricade here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You don't plan on going that way, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:48.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I hope this isn't a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:49.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:52.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:57.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,aren't we walking into the\NBrigade's trap by doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:03.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though we can confirm where the survivors\Nare, it's suspicious that there's no response.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:05.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You think all the troops were wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:08.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:10.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're thinking it too, right, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:12.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She can't be the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:15.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then what is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:19.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, a cyborg is the first\Nthing that came to my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:24.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you forget that they are a sect\Nof the Human Emancipation Front?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:28.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are a group that opposes\Ncyborgs and cyberbrains,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:30.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.79,0:07:36.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition, the DNA test results\Nfrom the SST's last report,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:38.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,how do you explain them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:45.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you think that the Brigade would\Nhave preserved blood and cell samples?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They could make a clone from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:50.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:51.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Umm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:55.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For example, trying to get Tokura's inheritance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:08:00.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There isn't any evidence to\Ncontradict the clone theory right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:06.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but there's no benefit to a clone suddenly appearing\Nas she did 16 years ago, other than to appeal to emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:10.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Clones can't legally inherit anything either...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:16.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though there are inconsistencies,\Nthey must have a reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:20.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you want to see what is\Ngoing on with your own two eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:24.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll investigate it once we\Nrescue the real person, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:28.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa-kun just can't stop murmuring can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:46.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank's for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:51.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No matter how you look at it,\Ncyborg food just seems tasteless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:52.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nonsense, want to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:09:00.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, we can't do anything\Nuntil the next GPS transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:03.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:09.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Think about this, the sea surrounds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.60,0:09:12.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They could be self-sufficient if they wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition to the ocean-lovers, this seems\Nlike an important trading place, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:21.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, but, this situation is\Nmore than just that data!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:25.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't even know how the terrorists go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The neighbouring countries might become hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:32.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, waaiit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:39.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh! Mister, nice robot you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:40.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:45.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll trade this thinking engine for that robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:50.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really? Show me, show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:54.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No way, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, I'll even throw in a Logical\NOperation Device that was made in Taiwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:03.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is a very valuable antique!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:09.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, Batou-San, SST member Sakakihara's\NGPS transmission has been confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:10.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:13.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is moving upwards this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I sure wish they'd just stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:19.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It doesn't matter if it's friend or foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:42.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're SST's Sakakihara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:45.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry, help's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:52.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please delete it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, what's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:11:00.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I beg you... delete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:08.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,WAH! Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:14.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, can you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:32.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What happened to the other three?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:35.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Th-They were killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If she became a leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:44.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Delete it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:46.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:49.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, what do you mean by leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:55.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She was alive... so why did such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:58.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Life is too cruel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:07.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did he connect? To her...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:09.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:19.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:22.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:27.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're definitely narrowing it\Ndown and getting closer to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:59.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa-kun, you're rather nervous, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:01.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is no time to be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:03.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, how is it over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:11.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The place in the photo is\Nright above here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:15.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There aren't any other control\Nrooms in this plant either...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:28.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where is Eka Tokura right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This bastard is underestimating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:41.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:50.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You know about the "dentist" torture, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:54.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I bet you've never felt it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:06.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, make sure no one comes in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:08.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:15.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:19.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've done the same thing over and over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:21.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When will you be satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no patience anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've rescued the SST survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:37.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's in good health, but his cyberbrain\Nwas slightly damaged by a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:40.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've tried radio transmission,\Nbut he couldn't respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:42.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:45.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go wait at the heliport.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll take care of things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:48.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's something you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:58.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That girl has something to do\Nwith Sakakihara going insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:08.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He couldn't say it directly, but it seems like\Nthat girl is becoming the leader of the Brigade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:11.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think you would\Nlose in a cyberbrain fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:15.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but at least be careful when\Nyou connect to that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:20.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From now on, you cannot leave\Nmy side without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why can't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:29.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you really want to leave me alone that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:32.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're always...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Acting like a princess, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:42.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or like a cliched revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:45.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:48.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry up, I won't warn you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:16.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you think you'll be able to walk\Nout of here alive if you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:33.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:38.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:50.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, a band of armed soldiers are closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:51.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They have infiltrated!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:17:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems like they're ambushing\NBatou-San from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:03.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, come here, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have our objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:05.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:07.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:11.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:11.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's started, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:29.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit, he's in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:32.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, take him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:33.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:34.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:35.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:42.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now we're the targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're fucking using their\Ncomrades bodies as shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:49.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:51.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, aim at the wires!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:52.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,High velocity ammo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You used something that powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:04.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wah! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:08.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Geez, they're not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:12.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're completely unafraid of\Ndeath despite not being cyborgs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:37.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where's Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:41.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Rescuing the female gorilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:43.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:55.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, don't attack, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:00.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:02.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why? To help you of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:06.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:11.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In the Tachikoma, because she's being annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:16.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's with that old woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:18.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bring her along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:20.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:24.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You'd better explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:26.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You go first, Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:28.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.83,0:19:35.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:36.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:39.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you forget that someone's in your pod!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:42.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, but, I want to fight more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:47.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Anti-tank missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:51.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't get shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:54.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Leave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:02.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Head for the control tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.33,0:20:11.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tachikoma, go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:13.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:21.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:52.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:52.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:02.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't touch my mom with your dirty hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:06.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,M-mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:06.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.01,0:21:08.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Such an unmanageable girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:09.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I said let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.11,0:21:12.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You! Don't touch my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let me go, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:28.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wow, that's the place from the rumours, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:30.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh? Where, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:39.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's really younger than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:45.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The media will be in an uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:47.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:52.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those SST people realised, just as the Major did,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.25,0:21:58.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that the old lady was the real Tokura\NEka, not the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When they figured that out,\Nthey tried directly connecting to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:08.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and they connected to her cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:10.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Delete it", huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At first, I didn't know what that meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:19.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It meant, "delete my memories", didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.34,0:22:22.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sixteen years after being kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:26.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a ten year old girl has aged\Nenough to look like an old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:33.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to even imagine\Nwhat happened during that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:41.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The remaining question is why Eka's daughter\Nended up in a position to lead those guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:44.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You want to find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Connect to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:51.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nah, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:00.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:03.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:05.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
